program files\\%' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE 'C:\\Program Files (x86)\\%' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE 'c:\\program files (x86)\\%' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE 'C:\\ProgramData\\%' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE 'c:\\programdata\\%' ESCAPE '\') OR (SourceImage LIKE '%\\procexp.exe' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE '%\\procexp64.exe' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE '%\\procmon.exe' ESCAPE '\' OR SourceImage LIKE '%\\procmon64.exe' ESCAPE '\')), 0)))))
